#: ../../source/docs/common-openpilot-revo-mini.rst:78
#: 7cd3561798aa4410b0b2c062af049089
msgid ""
"The RevoMini likely is the smallest footprint autopilot hardware to support "
"ArduPilot. It does not offer CAN bus connectivity or sufficient onboard "
"memory for storage of relevant logging data. However, external I2C or SPI "
"peripherals can be added with limited effort."
msgstr ""
"RevoMini 可能是支持 ArduPilot 的占地面积最小的飞控硬件。它不提供 CAN "
"总线连接，也没有足够的板载内存用于存储相关日志数据。但是，可以以较少的工作量添加外部 I2C 或 SPI 外设。"

